<title>HONG KONG: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on HSBC.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on HSBC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial</p>
<p>Products (Guernsey) Ltd said it has issued 180 million</p>
<p>American-style call warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$184.20	 PREMIUM	  19.12 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.998	  GEARING	  16.33X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  26.NOV.97	 PAYDATE	  10.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   12.DEC.96</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$163	    MIN EXER LOT   4,000</p>
<p>NOTES: CASH SETTLEMENT OF EXERCISE AMOUNT PAYABLE IN HONG KONG DOLLARS OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF STOCKS AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
